    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Corrected the washed-out preview rendering. Diffuse textures now enter lighting in the correct color space, the viewer no longer forces a blue-grey tint onto weapon layers, and the old exposure curves that lifted and desaturated the output are gone. The real hidden WebGL suite passed again for the Volcanic Pistol, Canned Peaches, Aged Pirate Rum, Jerky, Cigarettes, and Potent Bitters. Some game textures are deliberately pale, but Lexeditor no longer adds its own bleaching.",
